---
---

<section class="bg-[#f8fafc]  px-4 md:px-10 lg:px-16 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 md:px-10 lg:px-16">
		<h2 class="m-0 text-center text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] lg:text-[44px] leading-[1] font-bold text-[#111827]">Every Summer, the Same Impossible Search.</h2>

		<div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-[repeat(4,250px)] justify-between gap-6">
			<article class="h-[314px] rounded-2xl border border-[#f1f5f9] bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]">
				<div class="mb-6 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-[0.85rem] bg-[#fef2f2]">
					<img class="max-h-[24px] max-w-[28px]" src="/images/summer/struggle/icon-burned.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="mb-[0.938rem] text-[17px] leading-7 font-semibold text-[#111827]">Burned before</h3>
				<p class="m-0 text-base leading-[26px] text-[#475569]">You've tried general camps, but they weren't a fit. Your child felt misunderstood.</p>
			</article>
			<article class="h-[314px] rounded-2xl border border-[#f1f5f9] bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]">
				<div class="mb-6 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-[0.85rem] bg-[#fffbeb]">
					<img class="max-h-[24px] max-w-[28px]" src="/images/summer/struggle/icon-refusal.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="mb-[0.938rem] text-[17px] leading-7 font-semibold text-[#111827]">Refusal after Day 1</h3>
				<p class="m-0 text-base leading-[26px] text-[#475569]">The dread of dropping them off, only for them to beg not to go back for Day 2.</p>
			</article>
			<article class="h-[314px] rounded-2xl border border-[#f1f5f9] bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]">
				<div class="mb-6 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-[0.85rem] bg-[#eff6ff]">
					<img class="max-h-[24px] max-w-[28px]" src="/images/summer/struggle/icon-understands.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="mb-[0.938rem] text-[17px] leading-7 font-semibold text-[#111827]">Nobody understands</h3>
				<p class="m-0 text-base leading-[26px] text-[#475569]">It's hard to find mentors who truly get the 2e/gifted mind and its intensity.</p>
			</article>
			<article class="h-[314px] rounded-2xl border border-[#f1f5f9] bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]">
				<div class="mb-6 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-[0.85rem] bg-[#ecfdf5]">
					<img class="max-h-[24px] max-w-[28px]" src="/images/summer/struggle/icon-failure.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="mb-[0.938rem] text-[17px] leading-7 font-semibold text-[#111827]">Can't afford failure</h3>
				<p class="m-0 text-base leading-[26px] text-[#475569]">Another bad summer experience can set back their confidence for the whole year.</p>
			</article>
		</div>

		<blockquote class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-[800px] grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[64px_1fr] items-start gap-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#0a9dfb] bg-[#eff6ff] p-4 lg:p-10">
			<img class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover" src="/images/summer/struggle/avatar-sarah.jpg" alt="Parent avatar" />
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
				<p class="m-0 text-[17px] leading-7 italic text-[#1a1647] font-medium">
					"We used to dread summer. Every camp was a battle of wills. YSA was the first time my son woke up early,
					excited to log in and see his 'people'."
				</p>
				<footer class="text-sm leading-6 font-medium text-[#475569]">- Sarah M., Mother of a 10-year-old 2e student</footer>
			</div>
		</blockquote>
	</div>
</section>
